define procedure_tool_schema returning Str:
    return "{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"procedure\",\"description\":\"Save and retrieve scoped procedural memory without executing it. search requires query (empty lists all) and after=0, then next_after until end. read requires event. save requires manifest. First discover each tool with tool_search; use its contract_sha256 and retain its result event/digest. Steps contain ordered actions, exact tool contracts, observed result_event/result_digest, and discovery_event/discovery_digest from that same execution run before the action. checks compare JSON paths under $.result to expected JSON values. Empty result/discovery references create a proposed workflow; demonstrated means all ordered recorded results match the declared checks, not universal success or authority to execute. Saved versions are immutable. Read rechecks source permissions and current tools; stale-tool requires revalidation. Check saved procedures before creating a new tool. Keep prerequisites and failure lessons explicit. set_visibility requires event, previous_revision from read, state visible or forgotten, and reason. Forgotten versions disappear from read/search/discovery; originals and the audit remain intact. Read a forgotten version by its event ID to obtain its revision for explicit restoration.\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"operation\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"save\",\"read\",\"search\",\"set_visibility\"]},\"manifest\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"purpose\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"prerequisites\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"failure_lessons\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"steps\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"tool\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"contract_sha256\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"result_event\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"result_digest\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"discovery_event\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"discovery_digest\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"checks\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"equals\":{}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"equals\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"required\":[\"action\",\"tool\",\"contract_sha256\",\"result_event\",\"result_digest\",\"discovery_event\",\"discovery_digest\",\"checks\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"required\":[\"name\",\"purpose\",\"prerequisites\",\"failure_lessons\",\"steps\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"event\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"query\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"after\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0},\"previous_revision\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0},\"state\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"visible\",\"forgotten\"]},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"operation\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}}"
